[38;5;231m⏺[39m So it's a blank slate. That reframes things: there are no tasks to change, no users to care, and no server for a
  change to arrive from. Before I design a notification system I need to know what makes a notification [3mmeaningful[0m here
  — a notification only earns its existence when something changes that the user isn't already watching happen.

  Right now the only actor is the person looking at the page. If they edit a task, they know — they just did it.

